*** Test Cases ***
CB008140_ET_FA012_Verify_Unsuccessful_SCell addition with scell candidates reject one by one at ext-Gnb-CU_ext-Gnb-DU_prim-Gnb-DU
    [Documentation]
    ...    this case is to test unsuccessful SCell addition with scell candidates are rejected at ext-Gnb-DU, ext-Gnb-CU and prim-Gnb-DU for
    ...    inter-gNB with 4CC(TDD-TDD-FDD-FDD) DL CA.
    ...    Requirement Coverage:
    ...    5G_RAN_USR_RRM_17897, partially covered
    ...    5G_RAN_USR_RRM_17898, partially covered
    ...    5G_RAN_USR_RRM_17899, fully covered
    ...    [Configuration]:
    ...    Cell id=1 gnb=2 pci=16:2 tac=200 tdd_cell=on band=n77 nr_arfcn=663400:663400 gscn=8159 chBw=100MHz
    ...    Cell id=2 gnb=2 pci=17:0 tac=200 tdd_cell=on band=n77 nr_arfcn=658000:658000 gscn=8103 chBw=40MHz
    ...    Cell id=3 gnb=3 pci=17:1 tac=200 tdd_cell=on band=n77 nr_arfcn=653400:653400 gscn=8072 chBw=100MHz weightForSCellSelection=10
    ...    Cell id=4 gnb=3 pci=17:2 tac=200 tdd_cell=on band=n77 nr_arfcn=648000:648000 gscn=8000 chBw=40MHz weightForSCellSelection=10
    ...    Cell id=11 gnb=3 pci=20:0 tac=200 tdd_cell=off band=n3 nr_arfcn=349400:368400 gscn=4605 chBw=10MHz weightForSCellSelection=50
    ...    Cell id=12 gnb=3 pci=20:1 tac=200 tdd_cell=off band=n28 nr_arfcn=143400:153400 gscn=1916 chBw=15MHz weightForSCellSelection=50
    ...    CELL 2_11: maxNumOfSCellAlloc=1
    ...    Scenario:
    ...      Cell1_1 has 3 NRRELs Cell2_3/Cell2_11/Cell2_12,when A1 MR triggered vlaue 120 higher than TDD threshold 111,UE19 using golden
    ...      capability would setup 4CCs CA with them as expected,but Cell2_3 as CSI-RS resource reached so result is 3CCs with Cell2_11
    ...      and Cell2_12(TDD-FDD_FDD),then CELL 2_11: maxNumOfSCellAlloc=1 reaches,at last while Pucch not enough,UE24 using golden capability
    ...      trigger A1 MR as above operation would not setup CA any more
    ...    2.Test Case Steps:
    ...         Step a. UE1-12 Register And PDU Session Setup On Cell2_3 to occupy Scell's CSI-RS resources.
    ...         (change UE1-18 to UE1-12, for 8140-H change, when set tddFrameStructure:lteToNrFrameShift=3ms,
    ...         TDD pcell CELL1-1 and TDD scell CELL1-3 should config same frame params,
    ...         or it will failed first the scell addition with TddFrameStructure check failure)
    ...         Step b. UE19 Register And PDU Session Setup On Cell1_1,then trigger A1 to setup CA to occupy maxNumOfSCellAlloc resource.
    ...         Step c. UE20-24 Register And PDU Session Setup On Cell1_1 to occupy Pcell's PUCCH resources.
    ...         Step d. UE24 Send A1 Trigger CA addition
    ...         Step e. Release all UEs
    ...    3. Expected Results:
    ...         Step a: UE1-18 Register And PDU Session Setup Successful,there's no CSI-RS resource on Cell2_3 any more.
    ...         Step b: UE19 setup 3CCs with Cell2_11 and Cell2_12, reject Cell2_3 as CSI-RS resource reached.
    ...                 maxNumOfSCellAlloc of CELL2_11 reaches.
    ...                'No free CSI-RS resource in csiRsResourcesInSsSlots' would be typed in CP-RT within btslog
    ...         Step c. UE20-24 Register And PDU Session Setup Successful,there's no PUCCH resources on Cell1_1 any more
    ...         Step d: No CA establishes for UE24 due to reasons below:
    ...                 Cell2_11 ScellAlloc resource not available on ext-gNB-CU.
    ...                 Cell2_3 CSI-RS resource not available on ext-gNB-DU
    ...                 Cell2_12 prim-gNB-DU not available to allocate PUCCH resource for scell.
    ...                'No free CSI-RS resource in csiRsResourcesInSsSlots' would be typed in CP-RT within btslog
    ...                'No Free LongPucch CSI Resource' would be typed in CP-RT within btslog
    ...         Step e: UEs are released successfully
